      <abstract id="aspace_da846b3b1021fa004db98499175648e8">The John Wolcott Papers document Wolcott's involvement in the revival of the historic Pinxter Festival, grassroots efforts to preserve the Pine Bush, and archaeological and historical research in Albany, New York.</abstract>
      <physloc id="aspace_7f9299cba47827a54f2d50bf1d04482f">The materials are located onsite in the department.</physloc>
